<content_layer>
QuantaHaba Design Editor
--------------------------
Welcome to QuantaHaba, an LLM-powered structured design editor!
This is a live preview of the demo.haba file format.
The document is split into content, presentation, script, and todo layers.
You can edit the raw text on the left pane and see live WYSIWYG updates.
The sidebar tabs on the right explore symbols, TODOs, and script execution outputs.
</content_layer>
<presentation_layer>
    <containers>
        h1
        hr
        p
        p
        li
        li
        li
    </containers>
    <styles>
        color: '#1B4D3E'; font-size: '26px'
        color: '#A3B19B'; font-size: '14px'
        color: '#2C3E50'; font-size: '16px'
        color: '#34495E'; font-size: '15px'
        color: '#2980B9'; font-size: '14px'
        color: '#2980B9'; font-size: '14px'
        color: '#2980B9'; font-size: '14px'
    </styles>
</presentation_layer>
